{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-vincitore-boulevard","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"vincitore-boulevard","about":"Nestled in the vibrant heart of Dubailand, Vincitore Boulevard emerges as a masterpiece of luxury living, boasting a four-level architectural marvel. Developed by the prestigious Vincitore Real Estate Development LLC, this iconic Vincitore Boulevard location in Dubailand sets a new standard for residential design. With 216 opulent apartments, including studios and 1 bedroom apartments, Vincitore Boulevard also offers 30 high-end retail spaces, enveloping residents in a total of 16,103 square meters of sophistication.Choosing to live in Vincitore Boulevard opens the door to a lifestyle peppered with avant-garde, luxury, and the latest in residential trends. Situated at the core of Al Barsha South's Arjan, Dubai, Vincitore Boulevard epitomizes a new era of luxurious living. The Vincitore Boulevard Dubai residences are all complemented by a host of amenities and services that hallmark the development's signature ambiance. Vincitore Boulevard's proximity to Miracle Garden offers residents awe-inspiring views, inviting them into living spaces designed for the ages.For those interested in Vincitore Boulevard Dubailand rent or purchase, apartments and studios are elegantly finished, with options available fully furnished or unfurnished. Features include large balconies, state-of-the-art kitchens, custom-built closets, and modern bathrooms, embodying the pinnacle of Vincitore Boulevard price and value. Whether you're seeking the luxurious lifestyle that Vincitore Boulevard Arjan Dubai offers, this residential complex stands as a testament to unparalleled living.","price":543000,"title":"Vincitore Boulevard ","bitrix":{"id":380,"pf_id":"are.2.9849","source":null,"project_id":"Vincitore Boulevard","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Vincitore Boulevard ","property_type